# MC-X-F12 (writer 9): as L4_3_band_row_reads_at_reader, with at on r (q) and law on the ask line (q2): b reads
# base at 2027-05-01 and 2027-02-01, 400.00 PLN.
=== m.tally
model p
  tally 2
  on 2027-12-31
  start 2027-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
source act "the act"
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2020-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input age3: int
input base: money PLN
def b: money PLN = base at reader
band rate(a: int): money PLN
def r[m in months]: money PLN = rate(age3) at start_of(m)
ask q: r[2027-05]
ask q2: rate(age3) law 2027-02-01

version v_law
  cite act
  governs 2027..
  known 2026-12-01
  base = 400.00 PLN "the base"

version v_act
  cite act
  governs always
  known 2026-12-01
  age3 = 3 "the age"
  rate: [0, 6) = b "under 6"
  rate: [6, 18) = 250.00 PLN "6 to 17"
=== expect
q: 400.00 PLN
  cut 2027-12-31
q2: 400.00 PLN
  law date 2027-02-01, cut 2027-12-31
